      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Once you click Run, your UI appears. If you wrote an <h1> tag on the editor, you'll see a heading. If something doesn't look right, this preview is where you'll catch it first."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So the Web View is the mirror for your code. Write → Run → Check. That's the loop you'll follow for every lesson."
